@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About the community";
}

<div class="container px-4">
    <div class="row gx-5 align-items-center">
        <div class="col">
            <div class='text-center'><img style='width: 350px; height: auto;' src="/img/theisle.png"><br /><img style='width: 650px; height: auto;' src='/img/spaceship.png' class='rounded-lg shadow-lg'></div>
        </div>
        <div class="col bg-secondary rounded-lg shadow p-3 mb-5">
            <div>Welcome to The Isle, the premier gaming community for the space adventure game (My) Dual Universe!</div><br />

            <div>In My Dual Universe, players embark on interstellar journeys, create gorgeous ships from mere points of light, architect productive factories, battle formidable foes, and uncovere the mysteries of the universe. But what truly sets The Isle apart is its incredible community of players.</div><br />

            <div>Our members are known for their unwavering support and camaraderie. Whether you're a seasoned space builder/explorer or a newcomer just starting your journey, you'll find a welcoming and helpful community ready to assist you. Need tips on the best strategies for flying? Looking for advice on how to optimize your spaceship? Our experienced players are always eager to share their knowledge and lend a hand.</div><br />

            <div>But it's not just about the game; it's about the friendships you forge along the way. In The Isle, you'll meet players from all walks of life, united by a shared passion for space exploration, coding/voxelmancy, and gaming. Together, we celebrate victories, learn from defeats, and create unforgettable memories.</div><br />

            <div>Join The Isle today and become part of a community where fun, friendship, and adventure are always on the horizon.</div><br />
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
